 운영하지 않지만, 자동차로 5분 거리에 대형 마트가 있다.","updated":"2026-05-15","facilities":[{"k":"주요시설","v":"카라반(9면)","items":["카라반(9면)"]},{"k":"카라반 내부시설","v":"침대 · TV · 에어컨 · 냉장고 · 난방기구 · 취사도구 · 내부화장실","items":["침대","TV","에어컨","냉장고","난방기구","취사도구","내부화장실"]},{"k":"캠핑장비대여","v":"캠핑장 문의","items":["캠핑장 문의"]},{"k":"반려동물 출입","v":"불가능"},{"k":"화로대","v":"개별"}],"photos":["https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/158774h0SZa7uFYkinsZcK5p.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/9801hynAdDr0ZlCknVMJNxH2.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/7969sjHt02IRh4r6LZy1kZXQ.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/2588BcxvCZd9bnoaoQCZRdPv.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/7614SACVVQBSffVygRdXA5fs.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/0637jFk4W3NQx0SrPm07xOGK.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/0585iqVHiLbQAoEoO12RD0bU.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/6583tT7fxgQSX5iPcSHxQT3n.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/94143JurfO5SUnp4rLGfuUMf.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/98856ClVI3cGRJtTFtGRJGYj.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/2780cpS7nV0FHO5gEZ2B9O6m.jpg","https://www.gocamping.or.kr/upload/camp/3147/6455zaL3Jia7ECqrdaWiyKOL.jpg"],"guide":[{"title":"카라반","table":{"cols":["평상시 주중","평상시 주말","성수기 주중","성수기 주말"],"rows":[{"label":"카라반","values":["90,000 ~100,000","140,000 ~150,000","170,000 ~180,000","170,000 ~180,000"]}]}}],"checked_at":"2026-10-20T03:22:49.926Z"}}